  "private": true,
  "description": "ระบบขออนุมัติภายใน (Internal Approval) — Memo ฝ่ายขาย",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start",
    "seed": "node scripts/seed.mjs",
